direction: down

browser: Browser
vite: Vite\ncurrent frontend
air: Air\ncurrent Go and Rust
embedded: Last embedded SPA build

browser -> vite: Open the frontend URL
vite -> air: Proxy API, docs, and metrics
air -> embedded: Backend URL only {style.stroke-dash: 4}
